A core operational axiom of epistemic governance is that **administrative efficiency does not establish structural integrity**. An institutional body may process claims, issue reports, and execute transactions with high operational velocity while simultaneously violating core statutory controls, failing to preserve records, and displacing underlying fiduciary duties.

### The 10-Tier Evidentiary Distinction Standard

To prevent unverified assertions, institutional narrative control, or administrative assumptions from contaminating factual findings, the +1HP framework mandates the categorization of all project inputs across a strict 10-tier evidence hierarchy:

```
[ Tier 01 ] VERIFIED FACT ------------> Authenticated source data, uncontradicted official records, empirical proof.
